{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022b.q31.material.recovered", "text": "阅读案例，并回答问题。张老师执教“策划一次出游活动”一课时，先带领学生欣赏学校周边秋景的照片，然后布置作业：制定一份出游活动的策划书。学生以小组合作的形式进行实践，但在作业完成的过程中，由于意见不一致，学生之间发生争执。在汇报时，大家的策划书也是五花八门，很多策划书的内容没有办法实施。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c184f429baae5c4b5791dffbfb41e38fc3c3bdc911cd6b5308f6ba4622c5f537", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1939, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2082, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c184f429baae5c4b5791dffbfb41e38fc3c3bdc911cd6b5308f6ba4622c5f537"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022b.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s1.k08", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s1.k09", "ntce.chuzhong.meishu.s2.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.314.r004", "ntce.outline.314.r005", "ntce.outline.314.r009", "ntce.outline.314.r010", "ntce.outline.314.r012", "ntce.outline.314.r013", "ntce.outline.314.r020", "ntce.outline.314.r032"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.meishu.2022b.q31"], "word_count": 143, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "meishu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半年教师资格证考试《初中美术》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c184f429baae5c4b5791dffbfb41e38fc3c3bdc911cd6b5308f6ba4622c5f537", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1939, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2082, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2022年下半